      ],
      "text": "The recommendations included herein are a component of the WHO consolidated guidelines on TB and",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.94486141204834,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        80.59070587158203,
        527.0971069335938,
        95.03370666503906
      ],
      "text": "are primarily intended for use by NTPs, public health agencies, and other key constituencies involved",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.99524974822998,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        93.79071807861328,
        527.4134521484375,
        108.23371887207031
      ],
      "text": "in the planning, implementation and monitoring of activities for the programmatic management of",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        106.99073028564453,
        105.82410430908203,
        121.43373107910156
      ],
      "text": "DR-TB.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        128.69459533691406,
        527.4578247070312,
        143.13758850097656
      ],
      "text": "Drug-resistant tuberculosis (DR-TB) remains a significant public health challenge, impacting patients,",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.999650001525879,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        141.8946075439453,
        527.572021484375,
        156.3376007080078
      ],
      "text": "communities, and healthcare systems profoundly. In 2023, global estimates suggest there were around",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.963138580322266,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        155.09474182128906,
        527.1959838867188,
        169.53773498535156
      ],
      "text": "400 000 new cases of multidrug- or rifampicin-resistant tuberculosis (MDR/RR-TB), yet less than half of",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.968103408813477,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        167.01869201660156,
        527.4505004882812,
        182.73768615722656
      ],
      "text": "(5) these cases were officially reported and began treatment  . Treatment success rates have improved,",
      "font": "SegoeUI-LightItalic",
      "size": 10.99069595336914,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        181.4947052001953,
        527.4168090820312,
        195.9376983642578
      ],
      "text": "rising from 50% in 2012 to 68% in 2021, but still, nearly 15% of those with MDR/RR-TB succumb to",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        193.41871643066406,
        527.570068359375,
        209.13771057128906
      ],
      "text": "(6) the disease  . Before 2022, treatment options for MDR/RR-TB were suboptimal, involving prolonged",
      "font": "SegoeUI-LightItalic",
      "size": 10.978128433227539,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        207.8946075439453,
        527.4313354492188,
        222.3376007080078
      ],
      "text": "treatment durations, a higher number of pills, and drugs with more severe side effects, leading to",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        221.09474182128906,
        527.3946533203125,
        235.53773498535156
      ],
      "text": "significant adverse events and less favorable outcomes. However, a breakthrough came in 2022 with",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        234.29469299316406,
        477.53289794921875,
        248.73768615722656
      ],
      "text": "the introduction of the first 6-month treatment regimen using three or four medications.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        255.9987335205078,
        527.4254150390625,
        270.4417419433594
      ],
      "text": "This current chapter concerns TB treatment and care; it presents WHO recommendations that have",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        269.1986083984375,
        527.2075805664062,
        283.6416320800781
      ],
      "text": "been newly developed and are published here for the first time, and existing recommendations",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        282.39862060546875,
        527.3924560546875,
        296.8416442871094
      ],
      "text": "that have been published in other WHO guidelines that applied the Grading of Recommendations",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
